Did you figure out how to use the wand?  Pick it up, point the wand's tip
at the number, and then press space. 

Once you copy something you can drop it by clicking a mouse button.

Wands can be used to double a number.

Just copy a number and drop the copy on top of it.

Well, here's how I would do it.  I'd pick up the wand and copy the 1.  I'd
drop the 1 on the original 1.  Then I'd copy the 2 and drop it on the 2.
I'd keep doing this until the wand runs out of magic.  The result should
be more than 1,000.

